      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that it might change my levels, but how much of a big deal is it really? i've taken it for like 4 days now and i feel totally fine. i don't really want to bother my doctor for every little supplement change, it's just a vitamin. like, can i just keep taking the same dose and keep an eye on things myself?",
